itación de la Emperatriz Celestial Hermesia, de la gran nación élfica —la Dinastía Magi de Salion—, para visitar su isla privada de vacaciones. Mientras el grupo disfruta de sus breves vacaciones, aparece una mujer misteriosa llamada Yura. Un nuevo incidente se desarrolla con el mar azul infinito como telón de fondo.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Fantasía","Aventura","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1363974","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:31.391Z"},{"id":"movie-1353926","slug":"movie-1353926","title":"特立独行","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dWtKXfN97AMW5n3S6QoUVUMCU2S.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Comedia","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1353926","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:31.698Z"},{"id":"movie-1453407","slug":"movie-1453407","title":"ग़ज़ब रात","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/e4N7M52cBbyi24xLga8yI6yt1u1.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1453407","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-22T12:06:32.005Z"},{"id":"movie-1321008","slug":"movie-1321008","title":"Black Box: Vuelo 298","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8udq8ixVhmGSBzcJRwCQrwBPqTF.jpg","synopsis":"El vuelo comercial 298 que cubre la ruta de Nueva Orleans a Seattle acaba estrellándose y convirtiéndose en el centro de un escalofriante misterio sobrenatural. El motivo del accidente se desconoce hasta que se encuentran las grabaciones entre los restos. Lo que les sucedió a los pasajeros del vuelo 298 escapa totalmente a la razón humana...","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1321008","type":"flyflix